  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.73,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I was speaking the other day to a man of cautious mind on a subject of current rumour.",
      "output_sha256": "16fc65bcdcba7af337102a58569442fcde90938cbb9db9f7379ac85792645c13",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "16fc65bcdcba7af337102a58569442fcde90938cbb9db9f7379ac85792645c13",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He remarked, \"If you had asked me about the veracity of such claims four months ago, I would have responded with a definitive 'Yes.' However, after the extensive disinformation surrounding the so-called Russian army, I now require solid proof before believing anything.",
      "output_sha256": "5b7017acb0cec38be0477fe35dbfe0cc8ec249594dced5c700ad7edf35a2e6c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.385164,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "68226a0c4753d207188f9e6807e26bd2148f8d27006388af84b2f0d4bf293679"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5b7017acb0cec38be0477fe35dbfe0cc8ec249594dced5c700ad7edf35a2e6c8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I was once convinced by the tales of a phantom army emerging from Archangel!",
      "output_sha256": "6cc989defd782a8155276223acd988fb61d1ca9ae2e7a2533b503b81b5066aa5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.411143,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "80c4525986bf3655fdd8d1aa6ddb8028442cf6682fecfc2a7c868a473fdba39d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6cc989defd782a8155276223acd988fb61d1ca9ae2e7a2533b503b81b5066aa5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There are people who say they didn't believe in it.",
      "output_sha256": "356606d2c6a286d70873a35e28f739e5c0fb899cd7e5d600a579710589695e0b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "356606d2c6a286d70873a35e28f739e5c0fb899cd7e5d600a579710589695e0b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Some of them believe they didn't believe in it.",
      "output_sha256": "672ac3213555ecb92402ab5ef5e658d0a14be70b5ae8afd9b991d85ec59559e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "672ac3213555ecb92402ab5ef5e658d0a14be70b5ae8afd9b991d85ec59559e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But I say defiantly that I did believe in it.",
      "output_sha256": "62a22dd77966d58497c974a53f5a381a2dc3d9bd761091a35bd7bee9ef311265",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "62a22dd77966d58497c974a53f5a381a2dc3d9bd761091a35bd7bee9ef311265",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And I say further that there was never a rumour in the world that seemed based upon more various or more convincing evidence.",
      "output_sha256": "d4152dfdc5494f54d75491b68b4eb9ebcde14d4346c81dc06004166db70b9b7c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "d4152dfdc5494f54d75491b68b4eb9ebcde14d4346c81dc06004166db70b9b7c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And it wasn't true….",
      "output_sha256": "f0045502e80a3d7c393678c477d7732b711e2717ae315fc1b033d6a1ff6381a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "f0045502e80a3d7c393678c477d7732b711e2717ae315fc1b033d6a1ff6381a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Now, I find myself transformed.",
      "output_sha256": "41ce99ecd2e29aea25a3cb08ba1ff748be32473c30de59ff071dc12b3fd29d8a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.330357,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ff0062d15795b0eea33e0e8edf075b2ead8dfeebab7e8ad8b9a7b4490dccfb24"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "41ce99ecd2e29aea25a3cb08ba1ff748be32473c30de59ff071dc12b3fd29d8a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I no longer consider myself a believer; I have become a skeptic.\"",
      "output_sha256": "a758ccb4bbc8ad4e711ec20e63cac9f38115702389a38d02cb031019f1765ef7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.5775,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e2dad4b59920b0d702a07441537ddf6cc52cfcabf40d2edb7fd0f4d8d652ef12"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a758ccb4bbc8ad4e711ec20e63cac9f38115702389a38d02cb031019f1765ef7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This experience, I suppose, is not uncommon.",
      "output_sha256": "8954b65d9c3bae3a48ed5ef387d8a2ef8f4c34a9f969204f74f0ea9e16969ec9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "8954b65d9c3bae3a48ed5ef387d8a2ef8f4c34a9f969204f74f0ea9e16969ec9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The man who believes as easily to-day as he did six months ago is a man on whom lessons are thrown away.",
      "output_sha256": "96a9d74346483ea3a498636c1ca6cd41299b95de4e2836fda22e9fc00e0ca5d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "96a9d74346483ea3a498636c1ca6cd41299b95de4e2836fda22e9fc00e0ca5d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We have lived in a world of gigantic whispers, and most of them have been false whispers.",
      "output_sha256": "5f9479a1138db42367a5e6674b6199b1fdb60a0c355f0d096f422363bfd4659a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "5f9479a1138db42367a5e6674b6199b1fdb60a0c355f0d096f422363bfd4659a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Even the magic word \"Official\" leaves one cold.",
      "output_sha256": "9e425b75441e023e58bd8d78810f223834bd9d6a696cc47e589be7a3fd6144e2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "9e425b75441e023e58bd8d78810f223834bd9d6a696cc47e589be7a3fd6144e2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is not what I am \"officially\" told that interests me: it is what I am \"officially\" not told that I want to know in order to arrive at the truth.",
      "output_sha256": "c869b8d1fa01b248e3378517a20a80a2a611de500229422b1ad863c589da64a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "c869b8d1fa01b248e3378517a20a80a2a611de500229422b1ad863c589da64a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "You remember that famous answer of the plaintiff in an action against a London paper years ago.",
      "output_sha256": "a64e6eb820a0456b05e4f3f7b503a71831d18f4f2d6534fc8cc55a232c7a7c6a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "a64e6eb820a0456b05e4f3f7b503a71831d18f4f2d6534fc8cc55a232c7a7c6a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"What did you tell him?\"",
      "output_sha256": "dadf65b920c9686ece62748152a640830419b90af3e80957f877379b6006fbd8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "dadf65b920c9686ece62748152a640830419b90af3e80957f877379b6006fbd8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"I told him to tell the truth.\"",
      "output_sha256": "d5c65ad55ba5bc6395d38704c6d00417d4c68b8500fb176ed96503d3f76fae5b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "d5c65ad55ba5bc6395d38704c6d00417d4c68b8500fb176ed96503d3f76fae5b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"The whole truth?\"",
      "output_sha256": "8e9b0f749023ad99061be81736aec8cc1f672bc89f3138ed28b8ac0014a1a044",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "8e9b0f749023ad99061be81736aec8cc1f672bc89f3138ed28b8ac0014a1a044",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"No, selected truths .\"",
      "output_sha256": "6f3df13e743415c2de9fe574a0e05eeb72231d6999074c43b18eb60efb57c000",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "6f3df13e743415c2de9fe574a0e05eeb72231d6999074c43b18eb60efb57c000",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In navigating the realm of rumors, we must be vigilant against our innate propensity to believe what we wish to be true.",
      "output_sha256": "605cfcfaf19fb07798159246dbac6302f4711cbda024ce8316deac89a1c5a0e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.393182,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ab153e650ba590eb17a199c5372a10effea3cb6df32ba54272ee2c071e110368"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "605cfcfaf19fb07798159246dbac6302f4711cbda024ce8316deac89a1c5a0e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A prime example is the reported victory in Poland in November 1914.",
      "output_sha256": "e689ceee1b7599353b30eda718c4589b3c0e1ac6aed18d8f3ce10decf59434ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.704167,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6b3387a50cc8603f75f90dc59f9c531cbd44b0ed0e5a72e16d071e056db00c6c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e689ceee1b7599353b30eda718c4589b3c0e1ac6aed18d8f3ce10decf59434ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Strong evidence suggests that a significant portion of Hindenburg's forces nearly fell into a trap; had Rennenkampf arrived on schedule, the encirclement would have succeeded.",
      "output_sha256": "73d0b36f3b8ee314f579321368e33ae9a37574ca900bed3a0bd6d6742c6a8820",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.394013,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7a4878f5441cf3dfefb5f57be990ef5ce991bb62255fbc165c1464f82c0ee09d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "73d0b36f3b8ee314f579321368e33ae9a37574ca900bed3a0bd6d6742c6a8820",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, it did not happen.",
      "output_sha256": "861f2f811c9f5c25f903e7c0c58a2ab104519a2f41d6da6e075e47826d6c192e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.26,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c0fdff422bc771c08334adb6f8191390dc5b2981ccc4e663dd20c5fd3db488e8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "861f2f811c9f5c25f903e7c0c58a2ab104519a2f41d6da6e075e47826d6c192e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yet nearly every correspondent in Petrograd sent the most confident news of an overwhelming victory.",
      "output_sha256": "e70d502f7230cc8122897ef7892b47f31f6cdec7dd6cbc49706ee7e5119922fc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "e70d502f7230cc8122897ef7892b47f31f6cdec7dd6cbc49706ee7e5119922fc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The correspondent for the Morning Post described it as an event \"terrible yet sublime,\" comparing it to the devastation left by Napoleon in Russia.",
      "output_sha256": "9e334bc9ee9404d297f46c82fd15cf7e2750c6a256ba9dc61bce3f93c23d54cb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.468452,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26,
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1679de2a73a3eb3318f5980d820780b3a5ec993a19b22aa992904f3801755ab8",
        "6e458be4891149df2980f3aae2451af0bacb5ae81de6f23d16e29d1f34a9a5f7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9e334bc9ee9404d297f46c82fd15cf7e2750c6a256ba9dc61bce3f93c23d54cb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Even Lord Kitchener, in the House of Lords, said that Russia had accomplished the greatest achievement of the war.",
      "output_sha256": "1a5350e62bca61fe21f4ccd3669f36158416fe273ad47f3cb31b001f567257d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "1a5350e62bca61fe21f4ccd3669f36158416fe273ad47f3cb31b001f567257d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And so, just afterwards, with the equally empty rumour of Hindenburg's \"victory,\" which sent Berlin into such a frenzy of rejoicing.",
      "output_sha256": "eded9165dbd296fc01f7f265edb8822d30387adb9d6d316f8f7ffe8621f7ed43",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "eded9165dbd296fc01f7f265edb8822d30387adb9d6d316f8f7ffe8621f7ed43",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It believed without evidence because it wanted to believe.",
      "output_sha256": "6673f4971f8c87c321871c062c3f2e01bca63897c9a5b8019944c31598189db4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "6673f4971f8c87c321871c062c3f2e01bca63897c9a5b8019944c31598189db4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And another fruitful source of rumour is fear.",
      "output_sha256": "e6d06666bb0b1533da3409cd26f3011aa781bf993ab648237f5b79ef58ffb6c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "e6d06666bb0b1533da3409cd26f3011aa781bf993ab648237f5b79ef58ffb6c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The famous concrete emplacement at Maubeuge will serve as an instance.",
      "output_sha256": "e50ee68f04fb1dba7293c59bf0b6a6ae5bdfffb78369a1e3c992a4b8a75f3dfc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "e50ee68f04fb1dba7293c59bf0b6a6ae5bdfffb78369a1e3c992a4b8a75f3dfc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We received extensive accounts detailing how German agents acquired the land, installed a concrete platform in secrecy, and utilized a massive 42-cm howitzer to bombard Maubeuge.",
      "output_sha256": "fc9f035987e47d2802c7bafc3c14ab6eb4a66eacfaf88d03b62decfec00c61d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.46437,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "109b74c3a6fd6434202606bfc8d53678db4f6971fdd772f2f4cf2d9ea6a65f31"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fc9f035987e47d2802c7bafc3c14ab6eb4a66eacfaf88d03b62decfec00c61d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And instantly we heard of concrete emplacements in this country—at Willesden, Edinburgh, and elsewhere.",
      "output_sha256": "18f94aee522beda9efde6d9d3979b1db8a91f42eeb19ef96412b8f2a4efb60b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "18f94aee522beda9efde6d9d3979b1db8a91f42eeb19ef96412b8f2a4efb60b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We began to suspect anyone with a concrete garage or workshop foundation of being a potential German operative.",
      "output_sha256": "88e288b2de02218af95151bad7d0db094c5c951a0fa983e679c0f8e2e0987974",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.601186,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "de0ff51b3cf3b887c2981470ffc4819d1790a1599b9044b07a6c380927429b0f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "88e288b2de02218af95151bad7d0db094c5c951a0fa983e679c0f8e2e0987974",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I confess that I shared these suspicions in regard to a certain factory overlooking London, and could not wholly argue myself out of them, though I hadn't an atom of evidence beyond the fact that the building had been owned by Germans and had a commanding position.",
      "output_sha256": "72798b8a1b8d3296fbe7a28d580ee3ac637dce513c57b2324da350861f413c6a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "72798b8a1b8d3296fbe7a28d580ee3ac637dce513c57b2324da350861f413c6a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I was ensnared by the myth of Maubeuge and the anxieties it engendered.",
      "output_sha256": "883f55552f099a4d7da28d87cc76612b4f5b460151c9fea89531b9aa86173a88",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.510476,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1380db6f5f5bf55c6ac8c2f7b8cb4d95524955e13c1e44138cb4bcf297073242"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "883f55552f099a4d7da28d87cc76612b4f5b460151c9fea89531b9aa86173a88",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yet there never was a concrete emplacement at Maubeuge, and no 42-cm. howitzer was used against that fortress.",
      "output_sha256": "5e2945d829256cc9a542f2dc4b42f380438fa35491f4088f9eff1618db6c5943",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "5e2945d829256cc9a542f2dc4b42f380438fa35491f4088f9eff1618db6c5943",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The property was owned by upstanding French citizens, and an apology from the Matin for slandering them remains accessible for those interested in the war's myriad myths.",
      "output_sha256": "87c234a70862ac764dfd75332ee34cb29c266faf43709f08dbce548be91b723c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.382698,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a11c0ae37038aa95985e3e49d6a1c5fe6dc7e7cb4ca8b240ae88a7fd362d6773"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "87c234a70862ac764dfd75332ee34cb29c266faf43709f08dbce548be91b723c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I refer to this subject to-day not to recall these historic fables, but to show what cruel wrong we may do to the innocent by accepting rumours about our neighbours without examining the facts.",
      "output_sha256": "a69026214cf6d4d7f10ad94c3fd0109c8d54f85a32e7bbadd9547f5c2fa3f426",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "a69026214cf6d4d7f10ad94c3fd0109c8d54f85a32e7bbadd9547f5c2fa3f426",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Was there ever a more pitiful story than that told at the inquest on an elderly woman at Henham in Suffolk?",
      "output_sha256": "e374543864e7cfe59c26268fc04dcbf8be6473a4e500f2534fbb53bbbf6d1e5c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "e374543864e7cfe59c26268fc04dcbf8be6473a4e500f2534fbb53bbbf6d1e5c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Her husband had been the village schoolmaster for twenty-eight years.",
      "output_sha256": "3d1b25c04a36ed10e3adea44b249a9793120866a435f2a25350a74d9ea2c6e6b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "3d1b25c04a36ed10e3adea44b249a9793120866a435f2a25350a74d9ea2c6e6b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The couple had a son whom they sent to Germany to learn the language.",
      "output_sha256": "190cdb74d019f2ec7a67d591ca71d3cdff8fabf345ff703809ea9196b451db06",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "190cdb74d019f2ec7a67d591ca71d3cdff8fabf345ff703809ea9196b451db06",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The average village schoolmaster has not much money for luxuries, and I can imagine the couple screwing and saving to give their boy a good start in life.",
      "output_sha256": "7f4b3bf7df6a9233a54d232aa5991f8e0d6da0ef025e67db0bc5f32f7b5d583b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "7f4b3bf7df6a9233a54d232aa5991f8e0d6da0ef025e67db0bc5f32f7b5d583b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When he had finished his training he set out to seek his fortune in South America, and there in far Guatemala he became a teacher of languages.",
      "output_sha256": "58d7100172087c1a16194286041748a396a80ab1358150a7bd4c94715352633e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "58d7100172087c1a16194286041748a396a80ab1358150a7bd4c94715352633e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When the war broke out he heard the call of the Motherland to her children and like thousands of others came back to fight.",
      "output_sha256": "d932063fb94b663c1b81a3591541e0f9ba67e426f0cc183a2342757c7252ec71",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "d932063fb94b663c1b81a3591541e0f9ba67e426f0cc183a2342757c7252ec71",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In the interim, however, malicious rumors began to circulate in their village.",
      "output_sha256": "50dc40ce06c3abe3dce28b6a18402da41e92906537084713566c4699256677af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.263873,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3838903f9decfdd934d3a67d0d9f73f3fcec8df1697c71bea7c96bf27681a90b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "50dc40ce06c3abe3dce28b6a18402da41e92906537084713566c4699256677af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It was said that he was an officer in the German Army, and on the strength of that rumour his parents were ordered by the Chief Constable to leave the village and not to dwell on the East Coast.",
      "output_sha256": "9d9b2e49a039e8207a781c02ca5104a8c54ca6fd8ca726ce078b90825ccba976",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "9d9b2e49a039e8207a781c02ca5104a8c54ca6fd8ca726ce078b90825ccba976",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It was a sentence of death on them.",
      "output_sha256": "03bf2b9ac96448d532aaaebd6daeef4c2090878a6a5eb26f8e9554b696964fe4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "03bf2b9ac96448d532aaaebd6daeef4c2090878a6a5eb26f8e9554b696964fe4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The order broke the old man's heart, and he committed suicide.",
      "output_sha256": "77523561a94e276249297230b55b8fa56c35c028450f7ff5890e59560da34fe9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "77523561a94e276249297230b55b8fa56c35c028450f7ff5890e59560da34fe9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "When the son returned home, he discovered his father had died and his mother was left in a state of devastation.",
      "output_sha256": "12f840ed7c58bcffcb52e6cbd1aa967e5db2ecaf2e850e3ae7dfcab0c2d938c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.374107,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ab677b2de6e774bfc0a80384a63d721a379f75dc584b226c83deb85637e0210d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "12f840ed7c58bcffcb52e6cbd1aa967e5db2ecaf2e850e3ae7dfcab0c2d938c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In an attempt to help her recover, he took her to the seaside, but upon their return to the village, she, too, succumbed to despair and committed suicide.",
      "output_sha256": "ff355597083be3759f2b2c95bfd4581aa83230b8beeb4109753df62de847dd74",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.583878,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "85e88177e47e7d014851b2d73a7216858a9dfab3ae95ad344e142bec2c424526"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ff355597083be3759f2b2c95bfd4581aa83230b8beeb4109753df62de847dd74",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The jury, rather than attributing the tragedy to \"Slander-induced Death,\" opted for the more clinical verdict of \"Suicide while of unsound mind.\"",
      "output_sha256": "8e05cb4423ece1ce470119b4f9622c20462659022a03235307089d3f6600e7b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.397853,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53,
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "381140d344353ecef6135b849c1f5440004d54a1f78546bf2d0824568d3968a4",
        "178bbc8b75ada9640b2f552b503169d7e48d11dbf3e3cba7d43d4354f0e840df"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8e05cb4423ece1ce470119b4f9622c20462659022a03235307089d3f6600e7b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "How do rumours get abroad?",
      "output_sha256": "613fdf7e2593b571d7993497c564c8e884b160709ca287e34ae0fefaf0da4db5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "613fdf7e2593b571d7993497c564c8e884b160709ca287e34ae0fefaf0da4db5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "There are numerous avenues.",
      "output_sha256": "d9e4fd36b1f7ee4441e42d7ff86f2f0e7bc3206240f22db9fba9b46f5fc95293",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.475,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "97a131d19a8a822c0f907060aef500830288782e86375933345f8207a846e70d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d9e4fd36b1f7ee4441e42d7ff86f2f0e7bc3206240f22db9fba9b46f5fc95293",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Let me illustrate one such pathway.",
      "output_sha256": "478e302d274cd9443af29d8ac737756b670853e49868058fbc5da164937b932a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.73,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "25d32112735be1a4a86fda316265434c5149e63d12958a8fcb68f3ff5a69de2a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "478e302d274cd9443af29d8ac737756b670853e49868058fbc5da164937b932a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In his criticism of the war the other week Mr. Belloc said:",
      "output_sha256": "a90f5fcbe3b13c048c2252582d85c7306e80908c2e86ec23d5a8de030aed02b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "a90f5fcbe3b13c048c2252582d85c7306e80908c2e86ec23d5a8de030aed02b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "\"The official German communiqué released last Saturday serves as a fine example for analysis.",
      "output_sha256": "36d7ad5ca030aad1bfd0a1e9d11cda4e799502b0c34b2d7501c2ff25896d871b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.52805,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "44c108d20ad85fc99cddad973f9509f5f66602bfcb0e9b65ed5a7af4858fbcf0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "36d7ad5ca030aad1bfd0a1e9d11cda4e799502b0c34b2d7501c2ff25896d871b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I quote it as it appeared in the Westminster Gazette (which has from the beginning of the war, and even before its outbreak, been remarkable for the volume of its German information ), and as it was delivered through the Marconi channel.\"",
      "output_sha256": "f87c6fdbb7779c2946ced7b82f112cb087d6b624431d486bf29280e3b816b2a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "f87c6fdbb7779c2946ced7b82f112cb087d6b624431d486bf29280e3b816b2a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He then proceeded to quote the communiqué.",
      "output_sha256": "67848bd7d0650bbccd994143eb48ea16921d97c5aa82b93e86068443d1fb5225",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.47974,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "62a849392d93c284d3019c2c690c2ad8c1cea8d1b704d23e1c099e0e64908f75"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_ai_sha256": "67848bd7d0650bbccd994143eb48ea16921d97c5aa82b93e86068443d1fb5225",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I couldn't help but smile at the cleverness of Mr. Belloc.",
      "output_sha256": "f944b9beb9770866524a5dd199bf59edf47bc0288a3e93608eb790031d50ee5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.369613,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5827eb01172496e9075654407b95de616514765125be092bb19e56a6e8edc6c7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f944b9beb9770866524a5dd199bf59edf47bc0288a3e93608eb790031d50ee5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He quotes a document which appeared in every paper in the country, but he says he quotes it from the Westminster Gazette.",
      "output_sha256": "4c82bd7c70b4b7a929d68e9cf628645425ec1e562e08507d500d26cef399a52c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c82bd7c70b4b7a929d68e9cf628645425ec1e562e08507d500d26cef399a52c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why, since it appeared everywhere, does he mention one paper?",
      "output_sha256": "379f26f69dfd65f75f3fb597e569e7d90c92defd6048321ae85bc961dcd3e388",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "379f26f69dfd65f75f3fb597e569e7d90c92defd6048321ae85bc961dcd3e388",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Obviously in order to make that parenthetical remark which I have italicised.",
      "output_sha256": "144abcf3155dcff4545104349fe900164424ab2861d2ef41fd61a6b3c6bb8728",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "144abcf3155dcff4545104349fe900164424ab2861d2ef41fd61a6b3c6bb8728",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Now the reputation of the Westminster stands too high to be affected by the suggestion that it is \"remarkable\"—which it isn't—for its German information.",
      "output_sha256": "6fc0fce1416dd9ada6528010722529de39c93c7bf6dad8315e81cc4f3ea851c6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_human_sha256": "6fc0fce1416dd9ada6528010722529de39c93c7bf6dad8315e81cc4f3ea851c6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But suppose you, a mere ordinary citizen, were alleged by some one to have special intercourse with Germany at this time.",
      "output_sha256": "4301ee56152808732f1349ed080f6a764765c02d90e843ff65273bb07de3a779",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_human_sha256": "4301ee56152808732f1349ed080f6a764765c02d90e843ff65273bb07de3a779",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "You might be as innocent as that Suffolk schoolmaster, but that would not save you from the suspicions of your neighbours and, perhaps, the attentions of the Chief Constable.",
      "output_sha256": "c0dc4a5d5f62e642e408ad112627abec33fc44cfa64957544476317446da2aa9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_human_sha256": "c0dc4a5d5f62e642e408ad112627abec33fc44cfa64957544476317446da2aa9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Allow me to provide another example.",
      "output_sha256": "27d06ac09abe7cdc8ec3c8883c5739d75a89993eb523d1e897c06bba8d2f4f6c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": 0.3875,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        69
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f9d1ef940ba0d3a92d5da7e462df8c5a8b8309de5404fcf2ca6ceb6469dd2686"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_ai_sha256": "27d06ac09abe7cdc8ec3c8883c5739d75a89993eb523d1e897c06bba8d2f4f6c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A friend of mine, a journalist with liberal leanings, recently attended a private dinner with M. Painlevé, a French academician, Senator Lafontaine from Brussels, and two other deputies from France and Belgium.",
      "output_sha256": "60643757ce59d86584618669b18d9b6b91faf09871d1a9f1015ca0dda608bf2e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": 0.677736,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        70
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a9fc4a4e56035bfb92be14d64e3aedf42838b33de359e01dc76c05ff7dd082a4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_ai_sha256": "60643757ce59d86584618669b18d9b6b91faf09871d1a9f1015ca0dda608bf2e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The next morning he was stated in the Daily Express (edited by Mr. Blumenfeld) to have dined with \" three or four foreigners \" for the purpose of discussing peace.",
      "output_sha256": "1904ebd64efd47020ce281e0bcd150d200f8bce3c4873ff580ab2c926707523e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_human_sha256": "1904ebd64efd47020ce281e0bcd150d200f8bce3c4873ff580ab2c926707523e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And in the next issue of the London Mail the question was asked, \"Who were the foreigners with whom ——— dined?\"",
      "output_sha256": "d66b89027af7cee50548a06b5229fde653532fa3638f589feb8775639c4c3c68",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_human_sha256": "d66b89027af7cee50548a06b5229fde653532fa3638f589feb8775639c4c3c68",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "You see the insinuation.",
      "output_sha256": "5ed6812b9e29b4b47ea90fad69d006f4964781f7bdd86e73d55cbda0096fbf7b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 73,
      "source_human_sha256": "5ed6812b9e29b4b47ea90fad69d006f4964781f7bdd86e73d55cbda0096fbf7b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "You see how the idea grows.",
      "output_sha256": "9ae8bf90eb1192ef23a67ab12fb83337f73b087f00ba405398f804083ce42622",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_human_sha256": "9ae8bf90eb1192ef23a67ab12fb83337f73b087f00ba405398f804083ce42622",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 73,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "My friend chose not to respond, recognizing that certain publications can be safely ignored, regardless of their claims.",
      "output_sha256": "747a7aef6c4a8c379c1f9bbf0cd43007992e9f69f366b2fef65cc145250540f4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": 0.264096,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        75
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2c400646e6013a3e05da83390b17939782fd433feb0af52f1022dd3f8747a0fc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_ai_sha256": "747a7aef6c4a8c379c1f9bbf0cd43007992e9f69f366b2fef65cc145250540f4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        68
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 74,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But I mention the thing here to show how a legend is launched.",
      "output_sha256": "39bdeaa740ab7cee1f69023b158188a5167c1d38a9a5bd80dc6607ba1f9c0fe9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 76,
      "source_human_sha256": "39bdeaa740ab7cee1f69023b158188a5167c1d38a9a5bd80dc6607ba1f9c0fe9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 75,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And the moral of all this?",
      "output_sha256": "67b2618a474a6a99cc46f8472e82be065889a45b89b6dfcf22f4a6e6c703f604",
      "alignment_unit_index": 69,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 77,
      "source_human_sha256": "67b2618a474a6a99cc46f8472e82be065889a45b89b6dfcf22f4a6e6c703f604",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 76,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is that of my friend whom I have quoted.",
      "output_sha256": "e331b2d9440ba37a5338d7b2ba23cfedc4b819269eaeb02f975820e1116c5407",
      "alignment_unit_index": 70,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 78,
      "source_human_sha256": "e331b2d9440ba37a5338d7b2ba23cfedc4b819269eaeb02f975820e1116c5407",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 77,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We should approach all rumors with skepticism, whether they pertain to events or individuals.",
      "output_sha256": "0366aaf4d0c343d0b3404186f06aa2370b45675f08f1e0b7a183954944197d11",
      "alignment_unit_index": 71,
      "alignment_score": 0.352857,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        79
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7893f65db0201ff033bb8e186e8c893771f5c328127e9573ef6d6587c8cbc381"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0366aaf4d0c343d0b3404186f06aa2370b45675f08f1e0b7a183954944197d11",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        72
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 78,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When Napoleon's marshals told him they had won a victory, he said, \"Show me your prisoners.\"",
      "output_sha256": "6a2000096d71270a1f25080960af7ea54ac8400d67c6bff627e40b037d61861f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 72,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 80,
      "source_human_sha256": "6a2000096d71270a1f25080960af7ea54ac8400d67c6bff627e40b037d61861f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 79,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When you are told a rumour do not swallow it like a hungry pike.",
      "output_sha256": "766283a2c8b32546553eff63217c76ace1cc873c4064f66721bef0d26334f20e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 73,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 81,
      "source_human_sha256": "766283a2c8b32546553eff63217c76ace1cc873c4064f66721bef0d26334f20e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 80,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Instead, we ought to inquire, \"Show me the facts.\"",
      "output_sha256": "c888a9ae87fa58bea5fef06f2f3c9f1ea47224082f1942124b26a3f20bd7dcaf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 74,
      "alignment_score": 0.420635,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        82
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d95e2fe60d794b6c27c1a866984b0a37c91f1575d34119afc95c26a5c74cc043"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 75,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c888a9ae87fa58bea5fef06f2f3c9f1ea47224082f1942124b26a3f20bd7dcaf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        75
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 81,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And before you accept them be sure they are whole facts and not half facts.",
      "output_sha256": "63a12610c798fe4e946e2f698461e21848413ccb7c87845cf1c1dbb373738382",
      "alignment_unit_index": 75,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 83,
      "source_human_sha256": "63a12610c798fe4e946e2f698461e21848413ccb7c87845cf1c1dbb373738382",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
